<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page journal-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/blog'>Learning library</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">lesson <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1>Bakhtawar Khan: learning, building and sharing in public</h1><p class="article-deck">A digital portfolio is more than a list of links. It can be a record of curiosity, progress and the work still ahead.</p></section>
<div class="academy-reading-layout"><aside class="academy-toc"><p class="academy-kicker">IN THIS GUIDE</p><nav aria-label="On this page"><a href="#main-content">Project overview</a></nav><div class="academy-author"><img src="/assets/images/mbk-personal-favicon-96.png" width="38" height="38" alt=""><div>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Founder, MBK Global</small></div></div><p class="academy-read-note">2 min read · Practical learning notes<br>Learn. Apply. Make it your own.</p><a class='academy-text-link' href='/resources'>More learning resources ↗</a></aside><div class="academy-reading-body"><p class="eyebrow">MBK JOURNAL / ARTICLE</p><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>← All articles</a></p><article class="journal-article" id="about-mbk"><div class="article-index">01 <span>PROFILE</span></div><div class="article-body"><p class="article-kicker">A PERSONAL INTRODUCTION</p><p>I’m Bakhtawar Khan, also known online as MBK. I’m interested in web development, practical AI tools, APIs, automation and the craft of making digital experiences feel clear and useful. My approach is to learn through small projects: plan a simple idea, build an interface, test how it behaves and keep improving it.</p><p>This website brings my projects, writing, visual work and online profiles together in one place. It is a work in progress by design. I want it to show not only finished links, but also the process behind them: what I’m exploring, what I’ve learned and what I want to make better next.</p><p>My focus is on steady progress rather than pretending to know everything. I value practical learning, honest descriptions and the kind of collaboration where a clear problem leads to a useful result.</p><div class="article-meta">BAKHTAWAR KHAN / MBK · PERSONAL PROFILE</div></div></article><p class="article-link"><a href='/blog'>Back to the MBK journal ↗</a></p><section aria-label="Related MBK portfolio pages" class="mbk-related-links"><h2>Explore related MBK pages</h2><p>Continue exploring Bakhtawar Khan (MBK), MBK Global projects and practical digital technology resources.</p><ul><li><a href="/">Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global — Web Development, AI &amp; Digital Technology</a></li><li><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Mr. Bakhtawar | Founder of MBK Global</a></li><li><a href='/projects'>Projects by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/services'>Web Development, AI, APIs &amp; SEO Services | Bakhtawar Khan</a></li><li><a href='/resources'>Web Development, API, SEO &amp; Accessibility Resources | MBK</a></li><li><a href='/blog'>Articles &amp; Guides by Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/official-links'>Official Links &amp; Projects</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/web-development'>Web Development Services</a></li><li><a href='/digital-branding'>Digital Branding &amp; Portfolio Presence</a></li><li><a href='/personal-branding-and-online-identity'>Building a Consistent Personal Brand Online | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li><li><a href='/content-strategy-and-search-intent'>Writing Useful Website Content | Bakhtawar Khan (MBK)</a></li></ul></section></div></div><div data-portrait-track data-caption="The person behind the work"></div></main><script src="assets/js/script.js"></script><footer class="academy-footer"><div><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><p>Thoughtful technology. Useful knowledge. Work in progress.</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/official-links'>Official links</a><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/resume'>Resume</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/privacy-policy'>Privacy</a></nav><div class="academy-colophon"><span>© 2026 Bakhtawar Khan · MBK Global</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer><script defer src="/assets/js/portfolio.js"></script><script defer src="/assets/js/visual-track.js"></script></body></html>